Compelled speech is not free speech. 25LSO-0031, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
The impact of this bill is indeterminable, as the fiscal impact would not be
known until a claim is filed against the State. However, there could also be a
fiscal impact from increased expenditures for awards or settlements for the
reimbursement of attorney fees.
The fiscal impact to the judicial system is indeterminable due to an unknown
number of cases.
